<report>
<line><title>Sample size for paired cohort study</title></line>
<line></line>
<line>Event rate in control group = <inu>pc</inu></line>
<line>Event rate in experimental group = <inu>ps</inu></line>
<line>Correlation for failure between experimental and control subjects = <inu>r</inu></line>
<line>Alpha = <inu>alpha</inu></line>
<line>Power = <inu>power</inu></line>
<line></line>
<line>Estimated minimum sample size = <in>size</in> pairs</line>
<block name="assumptions">
<line></line>
<line>NB:Assumptions of this calculation may cause over estimation of sample size when power is low.  However, true power associated with <in>cases</in> cases will be no less than <in>no_less</in> and no greater than <in>no_greater</in>.</line>
</block>
</report>
